					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "SIGN\n\nThe Sign node computes the sign of the incoming signal.\n\nThis means that the node will output -1 when the input is negative, 1 when the input is positive and 0 when the inpuit is 0.\nSign is often used to normalize one-dimensional vectors as it allows 0 as an valid input."
					}
				},
